cel-shaded characters with bold ink linework that keep exactly the same design, colours and art style from the first frame to the last; dramatic low-key lighting, deep shadows, teal-and-amber palette with pink neon, heavy rain and volumetric fog in Mumbai at night; deliberate, weighty, epic camera movement.\n[Shot 1] One continuous take. The jet of water blasts Kala Kutta: a huge black cane corso dog with cropped pointed ears, a white chest patch and a thick shiny gold chain collar and Ganja Gundappa: a bald, heavy-browed, menacing middle-aged man with a vertical orange-and-red tilak on his forehead, cold dark eyes, brown leather jacket over a dark t-shirt, olive-green cargo trousers and brown boots in the face; the dog is knocked sideways and rolls on the wet road, the motorcycle skids out, slides on its side and crashes, and Ganja Gundappa: a bald, heavy-browed, menacing middle-aged man with a vertical orange-and-red tilak on his forehead, cold dark eyes, brown leather jacket over a dark t-shirt, olive-green cargo trousers and brown boots slips off and lands flat on his face on the asphalt. The camera holds a wide side view.\noverall_soundscape: Gushing water, a dog yelping, tyres screeching, metal scraping across asphalt, a heavy thud, rain.\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A"],"widgets_values_named":{"value":"@Image 1 is the first frame. @Image 2 is the last frame.\nintegrated_multimodal_description: A cinematic graphic-novel animated film: painterly 2D cel-shaded characters with bold ink linework that keep exactly the same design, colours and art style from the first frame to the last; dramatic low-key lighting, deep shadows, teal-and-amber palette with pink neon, heavy rain and volumetric fog in Mumbai at night; deliberate, weighty, epic camera movement.\n[Shot 1] One continuous take. The jet of water blasts Kala Kutta: a huge black cane corso dog with cropped pointed ears, a white chest patch and a thick shiny gold chain collar and Ganja Gundappa: a bald, heavy-browed,